setup, TEST-038, TEST-040] all pair with a case-sensitive .sh grep -Eq /
grep -n -E; every .Contains() site pairs with a case-sensitive .sh grep -Fq.
This extends T-001's own load-bearing-and-case-sensitivity-evidence.log,
which covered 3 of these 7 -cmatch sites [TEST-004, TEST-014, TEST-026] with
