  --- mis-cased anchor 'Design-Sync-Loop`' against pattern 'design-sync-loop`' (must be NOT FOUND if parity with .sh held) ---
  FOUND at index 1 -- DIVERGENCE: .ps1 -match is case-INSENSITIVE, matched 'Design-Sync-Loop`' where .sh's plain grep (case-sensitive, no -i) would not
  --- correctly-cased anchor 'design-sync-loop`' (must be FOUND) ---
  FOUND at index 1 (correct)

Confirmed: same divergence pattern as F-1, demonstrated at this call-site
specifically.

