=== Whether F-1 / F-2 affect the live tree today ===

No. Re-verified by direct read at this task's implementation time:

  $ grep -n '^## ' plugins/sdd-bootstrap/skills/design-sync-loop/SKILL.md
  22:## Capability Detection
  32:## Ensure design-system/
  66:## Loop
  160:## Design-Source consent record
  207:## Boundaries

  $ grep -n -i 'design-sync-loop`' CHANGELOG.md
